<title>UK: Nestle unit sets 100 mln stg 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Nestle unit sets 100 mln stg 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NESTLE HOLDING (UK) PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  NESTLE SA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    25.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.7475  PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.56     SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG  ISSUER ONLY CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWITZ     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6 PCT AUGUST 1999 GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
